  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></semantics></math> có nghĩa khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></semantics></math> có nghĩa khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo>